  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, the slope of the required line is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>, then</p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> equation of the lines are <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math> &amp;&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
